flowchart TB
    accTitle: Platform and project lifecycle
    accDescr: Administrators prepare runtime, trust and environment permissions. Project authors then create and validate content, obtain review, sync a fixed commit, release execution and inspect results. Runtime changes follow a separate tested upgrade path.
    P["Platform administrator<br/>Runtime, network and trust"] --> E["Connect project<br/>Runners, credentials and environment"]
    E --> A["Author project<br/>Playbooks, inventory and tests"]
    A --> R["Validate and review changes"]
    R --> S["Sync fixed commit<br/>Review staging receipt"]
    S --> D["Approve execution<br/>Verify targets and reports"]
    D -->|Next reviewed change| A
    P --> U["Runtime change<br/>Test image and upgrade nodes"]
    U --> E
    classDef platform fill:#eef4ff,stroke:#4972a7,color:#172b4d
    classDef project fill:#edf8f2,stroke:#3d8164,color:#143b2b
    class P,E,U platform
    class A,R,S,D project
